1
00:01:51,355 --> 00:01:55,647
猫咪!猫咪!猫咪!
Kitty! Kitty! Kitty!

2
00:01:56,439 --> 00:01:57,272
等等!
Wait!

3
00:01:57,314 --> 00:02:00,272
别走 啊啊 快来小猫咪
No no uhh... Here, kitty kitty kitty.

4
00:02:00,314 --> 00:02:02,480
小猫咪 快过来
Here, kitty kitty kitty...

5
00:02:02,522 --> 00:02:04,022
过来呀 猫咪
Oh, come on, kitty.

6
00:02:04,064 --> 00:02:04,939
咿呀啊!
Eeek!

7
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:06,939
是猫猫的后半身
A cat's hindquarters.

8
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,855
呃 打扰一下
Umm... Excuse me.

9
00:02:09,897 --> 00:02:10,855
不打扰
You're excused.

10
00:02:15,522 --> 00:02:19,522
呃 你好 猫猫?
Uhh... Hello... Cat?

11
00:02:22,730 --> 00:02:24,230
好奇猫?
Curious Cat?

12
00:02:24,272 --> 00:02:26,064
该怎么称呼你?
Which one do you go by?

13
00:02:26,105 --> 00:02:28,272
噢 我不需要"称呼"
Oh I don't 'go by'.

14
00:02:28,314 --> 00:02:30,939
它们应归于流逝的岁月
That belongs to the days and the years.

15
00:02:31,272 --> 00:02:33,439
不过你要问我是什么的话
But if you are asking me what I am,

16
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:38,564
那我想我的确是只猫 非常好奇的猫
I do suppose I am indeed a cat -- most curious.

17
00:02:39,105 --> 00:02:40,522
好好的
Qf... course...

18
00:02:42,689 --> 00:02:46,189
是这样的 我和我的朋友们非常需要去到那棵树
Look, my friends and I really need to get to that giant tree.

19
00:02:46,522 --> 00:02:49,189
到目前为止 我们不论如何尝试都靠近不了它A
And so far, nothing we've tried has gotten us any further.

20
00:02:49,272 --> 00:02:51,480
它看上去甚至变得更远了!
It looks to me like we are even father!

21
00:02:51,647 --> 00:02:54,272
我觉得那是因为我们现在也就十几厘米高
Yeah, I think that's because we are six inches tall.

22
00:02:55,605 --> 00:02:57,230
都有可能
It could be both.

23
00:02:57,355 --> 00:02:58,605
那棵树!
The tree!

24
00:02:58,730 --> 00:03:01,147
树啊 树啊 树 树 树
Tree, tree, tree, tree....

25
00:03:01,605 --> 00:03:05,814
当然 要去到那边几是不可能的
Of course, that is most definitely impossible.

26
00:03:05,855 --> 00:03:08,897
你不能去找树 必须要树来找你
You do not go to the tree, the tree goes to you.

27
00:03:08,939 --> 00:03:10,814
除非你是我
Unless, of course, you are me.

28
00:03:10,855 --> 00:03:12,147
明自了吗?
You see?

29
00:03:12,189 --> 00:03:13,189
完全不明白
Not even a little bit.

30
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:14,980
那就是你的问题了
Well, that's your problem.

31
00:03:15,355 --> 00:03:17,564
这恐怕是因为大家视角不同吧
It's a matter of perspective, I'm afraid.

32
00:03:17,980 --> 00:03:19,855
但是 呃 你不能带我们去嘛?
But, uhh... Couldn't you take us, then?

33
00:03:20,314 --> 00:03:21,230
你之前去过那边的
You've been there before.

34
00:03:21,272 --> 00:03:24,272
所以我为什么要回去呢?
So why would I ever want to go back?

35
00:03:24,522 --> 00:03:27,230
是的 我很开心我们互相理解了
Yes, I'm glad we understand one another.

36
00:03:27,272 --> 00:03:29,855
已经看过的风景不需要再看一遍
No sense in seeing a site seen.

37
00:03:32,522 --> 00:03:35,189
拜托了! 你之前也帮助了爱丽克丝...
Please! You helped Alyx when she was...

38
00:03:34,772 --> 00:03:35,730
爱丽克丝!
Alyx!

39
00:03:36,230 --> 00:03:37,814
你是说 那个爱丽克丝?
Alyx, Alyx?

40
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:39,397
你们怎么认识她的?
How do you know her?

41
00:03:39,855 --> 00:03:40,939
你们是她的朋友吗?
Are you friends of hers?

42
00:03:40,980 --> 00:03:42,564
还是劲敌?
Life-long nemesis?

43
00:03:42,647 --> 00:03:43,897
等等等等 先别告诉我
Wait, don't tell me.

44
00:03:45,397 --> 00:03:46,355
好吧 不行 快告诉我!
Okay, no, tell me!

45
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:49,314
呃 我们并不认识她本人
Uhh... We don't know her personally.

46
00:03:49,397 --> 00:03:50,022
只是 呃
Just... Uhh...

47
00:03:49,897 --> 00:03:50,647
她写了本书
She wrote a book.

48
00:03:50,980 --> 00:03:53,064
关于她在永恒仙境的整个冒险
About her entire adventure in the Ever After.

49
00:03:53,105 --> 00:03:54,272
一本书?!
A book?!

50
00:03:54,522 --> 00:03:55,897
那本书受人喜爱吗?
Is it well-liked?

51
00:03:55,939 --> 00:04:00,230
在我们的家乡 那本书几乎是所有小孩最喜欢的故事了
It's kind of a childhood favorite of everyone's where we're from.

52
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:04,064
太好了!拜托了 我需要知道更多!
Yes! Oh please, I simply must know more!

53
00:04:04,105 --> 00:04:05,147
她写了些什么?
What did she write about?

54
00:04:05,189 --> 00:04:06,355
是怎么描绘我的?
How was I portrayed?

55
00:04:06,397 --> 00:04:09,355
然后 我是闻到了老鼠味吗?
And.. Do I smell a mouse?

56
00:04:10,730 --> 00:04:15,814
呃啊 大家都是猫 可以稍微等我们一下吗?
Ummm. From one cat to another, could you give us a minute, please?

57
00:04:15,897 --> 00:04:15,939
Ummm... From one cat to another, could you give us a minute, please?

58
00:04:16,105 --> 00:04:18,355
噢 所以它有主了
Oh, so they're spoken for.

59
00:04:18,605 --> 00:04:19,939
行吧 行吧 你们快点
Well, please, please hurry.

60
00:04:19,980 --> 00:04:22,439
我还有好多好多问题想问呢
Thave so many MANY questions.

61
00:04:25,522 --> 00:04:28,605
它真的不是叫做好烦猫吗?
Are we sure they're not called the Constantly Annoying Cat?

62
00:04:28,647 --> 00:04:30,897
真棒棒! 爆梗了!
Got 'em! Totally roasted!

63
00:04:30,939 --> 00:04:31,647
谢谢
Thank you.

64
00:04:31,772 --> 00:04:35,272
各位 好奇猫在书里被描述为伙伴
Guys. The Curious Cat was described as an ally

65
00:04:35,397 --> 00:04:36,939
它只是非常喜欢收集信息
With an appetite for information

66
00:04:37,105 --> 00:04:42,730
虽然它不想再去一次树边 但不代表我们不能把它吸引过去
Just because they dont want to go back to the tree, doeshit mean we can't lure them there.

67
00:04:42,897 --> 00:04:46,897
嗯 对 我们只要在途中一直吊着它的注意力就行了
Okay, yeah, we just need to keep their attention along the way.

68
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:49,897
这应该不难 我们有很多的.
That shouldn't be too hard. We know all sorts of..

69
00:04:49,939 --> 00:04:50,480
猫不见了
The cat's gone.

70
00:04:50,522 --> 00:04:53,730
啊啊啊!? 不要啊!
Ah!? No! Uh... No no no!

71
00:04:58,355 --> 00:04:59,022
等等我们!
Wait up!

72
00:04:59,064 --> 00:05:01,105
你不是有问题要问我们吗?
Didn't you have questions for us?

73
00:05:01,147 --> 00:05:02,939
我们非常乐意回答
We'd be happy to answer them.

74
00:05:03,772 --> 00:05:06,064
我觉得「后面』的条件要来了
I sense a 'but' approaching

75
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:12,147
不不不! 我是说 我们的确还是想要去到树那边
No, no! I mean, we do still need to go to the tree.

76
00:05:12,272 --> 00:05:14,439
但是 旅途很长 不是吗?
But, that'll take ages,right?

77
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:18,314
我们有足够的时间来跟你讲述我们那个世界的东西 哈哈
Plenty of time to tell you all the stuff from our world, haha...

78
00:05:18,355 --> 00:05:20,647
你看! 你之前见过卷轴吗?
Look! Have you seen a scroll before?

79
00:05:21,772 --> 00:05:23,689
发光的方块!
Luminous rectangle!

80
00:05:23,980 --> 00:05:26,064
哇哦! 这个按钮是做什么的?
Woo! What does this button do?

81
00:05:29,647 --> 00:05:31,980
为什么它会画出小小的平面版的我?
Why is it painting tiny flat versions of me?

82
00:05:32,397 --> 00:05:33,647
我笑起来是这样的吗?
Is that what I look like smiling?

83
00:05:33,855 --> 00:05:35,939
鱼儿上钩了
Hook, line, and sinker.

84
00:05:34,647 --> 00:05:36,689
我有好多问题! 真是太令猫激动了!
So much more questions! How exciting!

85
00:05:37,105 --> 00:05:40,689
所以那个老头和小男孩在用同一个身体?
So the old man and the boy share a body now?

86
00:05:40,730 --> 00:05:42,855
哇哦 总给我一种不太舒服的感觉
Woo, that's got some uncomfortable implications..

87
00:05:42,897 --> 00:05:45,439
到底是哪个大聪明觉得这样转世是个好主意的?
Who thought that was a helpful way to reincarnate?

88
00:05:45,522 --> 00:05:47,480
跟把城市放在天上的是同一帮人啊
The same people who put a city in the sky

89
00:05:47,689 --> 00:05:53,022
噢噢! 说起擎天 那个维特节上的希尔小姑娘还有什么重要的故事吗?
Oh! Speaking of Atlas, did that Ciel girl from the Vytal festival ever come back in a notable way?

90
00:05:53,564 --> 00:05:56,397
真是有太多太多的角色要去记住了!
There are just so many characters to keep track of!

91
00:05:56,564 --> 00:05:58,939
等等 我最开始问的是什么来着?
Wait, what was my original question?

92
00:05:59,355 --> 00:06:01,939
Blake 该你回答了
Blake, it's your um.

93
00:06:02,064 --> 00:06:04,689
你问我们关于树不子的起源
You have asked about the origins of Remnant.

94
00:06:05,105 --> 00:06:07,480
啊是的! 那对兄弟!
That's right! Woof! Those two brothers!

95
00:06:07,522 --> 00:06:10,522
真是很严重的神控啊 对吧?
Talk about a god complex, am I right?

96
00:06:10,855 --> 00:06:12,605
总的来说 是个有意思的总结
All in all, a rather entertaining summary.

97
00:06:12,647 --> 00:06:16,272
虽然我觉得有些角色的塑造多少有些乏味了
Though I felt some of the character voices were a bit uninspired.

98
00:06:16,314 --> 00:06:18,689
是不是呀 聪w明的小猎人
Looking at you, wise Huntress.

99
00:06:18,730 --> 00:06:21,314
我说过了 我叫Weiss 只是Weiss
Again, it's Weiss, just Weiss.

100
00:06:21,355 --> 00:06:23,314
啊哈哈 不好意思
Ah haha, apologies.

101
00:06:23,355 --> 00:06:28,064
不得不说 你们对于树不子的起源知道的可要比爱丽克丝多了不少
To your credit, you lot certainly know more about the beginnings of Remnant than Alyx did.

102
00:06:28,397 --> 00:06:30,814
那姑娘什么都不知道
That girl could barely see past her own nose

103
00:06:30,855 --> 00:06:32,064
什么意思?
What do you mean?

104
00:06:32,105 --> 00:06:33,480
哦 你知道的
Oh, you know.

105
00:06:33,814 --> 00:06:37,564
她一直在纠结一些不怎么重要的小事
Just hilariously concerned with trivial things.

106
00:06:37,689 --> 00:06:41,064
是的 但是 她最终也吸取教训并成长了 不是吗?
Yeah, but, she learned her lesson in the end, right?

107
00:06:41,105 --> 00:06:43,064
我当然这么觉得
I'd certainly say so.

108
00:06:43,230 --> 00:06:45,064
噢! 看看啊!
Oh! Would you look at that!

109
00:06:45,897 --> 00:06:48,355
这就是园林那亩地的边境
The edge of the Garden's Acre.

110
00:07:01,397 --> 00:07:05,022
这整个世界就像是一大堆乱七八糟的拼图堆成的
This entire world is put together like a bunch of mixed up puzzle pieces.

111
00:07:05,397 --> 00:07:07,022
到底会有谁能理解这地方?
How does anyone make sense of thist

112
00:07:07,522 --> 00:07:11,647
每一亩地都是专门为它的居民以及它们的任务而塑造的
Each Acre is made specifically for its inhabitants and their roles.

113
00:07:11,980 --> 00:07:13,647
树不子不是这样吗?
Is it not like that on Remnant?

114
00:07:14,730 --> 00:07:15,230
不是
No.

115
00:07:15,855 --> 00:07:17,647
真奇怪啊
How strange.

116
00:07:18,022 --> 00:07:20,272
我都没想过要问这个问题
It never even occurred to me to ask that before.

117
00:07:20,564 --> 00:07:22,439
我倒是有个问题要问问
I have a question I'd like to ask.

118
00:07:22,647 --> 00:07:25,564
还要多久我们才能变回正常大小?
How much longer before we're back to regular size?

119
00:07:25,772 --> 00:07:26,939
不用太久了
Not long at all.

120
00:07:27,105 --> 00:07:28,772
园林就在这条路前方
The Garden is just down this path.

121
00:07:28,814 --> 00:07:33,980
那里会有我们做美味的变大芭菲所需要的所有材料
And it's sure to have all the ingredients we need for a lovely grow-gurt parfait.

122
00:07:34,105 --> 00:07:36,480
不过 我不在的时候别跟人说话
Just don't go talking to anyone without me.

123
00:07:37,147 --> 00:07:38,480
你们要是不小心的话.
If you're not careful...

124
00:07:38,730 --> 00:07:40,897
我们的脑袋就没了
We might get our heads cut off.

125
00:07:40,939 --> 00:07:42,980
我们确实是这么认识的 对吧?
That is how we met, isn't it?

126
00:07:45,105 --> 00:07:48,439
你们树不子人真是会制造麻烦
Oh you Remnant folk are such trouble makers.

127
00:07:49,855 --> 00:07:53,564
我们要是正常大小也就不会搞出这么多麻烦了
Well, I'm sure we'll cause a lot less trouble once we're back to normal.

128
00:07:54,397 --> 00:07:55,689
我不知道你为什么这么烦躁
I don't see what all the fuss is about.

129
00:07:55,730 --> 00:07:58,980
我有许多好朋友都只有十几厘米高
Some of my best friends are six inches tall.

130
00:07:59,022 --> 00:08:01,605
如果我是你的话 我会更加担心...
If I were you, I'd be more worried about...

131
00:08:02,064 --> 00:08:04,980
你们提到的那个吓人的女巫叫什么来着?
Who was that scary sorceress you mentioned?

132
00:08:05,022 --> 00:08:07,147
Solim? Salem?
Solim? Salem?

133
00:08:07,355 --> 00:08:10,689
她还需要几个圣遗物就能摧毁世界了?
How many more relics does she need to end the world again?

134
00:08:12,064 --> 00:08:15,439
现在擎天没了你们要怎么阻止她呢?
How are you even supposed to stop her now that Atlas's gone?

135
00:08:23,605 --> 00:08:26,397
呃 露宝宝
Uhh... Hey, Rubs.

136
00:08:26,647 --> 00:08:27,272
我...
I...

137
00:08:29,189 --> 00:08:32,272
我们现在或许还不需要担心家里的事
Maybe we shouldn't worry about home right now.

138
00:08:32,522 --> 00:08:33,897
这里已经有足够多的问题让我们..
We've got enough problems to...

139
00:08:33,939 --> 00:08:34,397
猫!
The cat!

140
00:08:34,439 --> 00:08:35,522
什么?啊啊啊!
What? Ah ahhh!

141
00:08:35,564 --> 00:08:38,689
不要啊 我只是走神了一下
Oh no! I wasn't paying attention.

142
00:08:38,897 --> 00:08:40,689
它去哪了?
Where did they go now?

143
00:08:40,939 --> 00:08:42,689
噢! 哈哈 它看到了一只虫虫
Oh! Haha, they saw a bug.

144
00:08:42,855 --> 00:08:44,689
你怎么什么都没说?!
And you didn't say anything?!

145
00:08:44,730 --> 00:08:47,939
那是条长得很奇怪的虫虫?
It was a very interesting bug?

146
00:08:49,355 --> 00:08:52,772
书里那么多角色 为什么我们偏偏遇上了这只猫?
Of all the characters from the book, why did it have to be the cat?

147
00:08:53,022 --> 00:08:57,272
为什么帮我们的不是愉快的木匠或者是锈骑士?
Why couldn't we have gotten help from the Lively Carpenter, or the Rusted Knight?

148
00:08:57,314 --> 00:08:59,272
一个大好人一个大帅哥
One was sweet, one was handsome.

149
00:08:59,522 --> 00:09:02,564
而且他们哪个的注意力都比金鱼要长!
And neither of them had the attention span of a goldfish!

150
00:09:02,605 --> 00:09:06,980
我觉得这附近的池塘里一定能找到金鱼的
You know, I'bet you could find a goldfish in one of these ponds.

151
00:09:08,564 --> 00:09:12,064
你们听到了吗?
Hey... Do you hear that?

152
00:09:24,522 --> 00:09:27,564
这就是那个园林吗?
Is this the Garden?

153
00:09:27,980 --> 00:09:30,439
看起来的确是个园林
It certainly looks like a garden.

154
00:09:30,605 --> 00:09:33,230
但是 哼歌的声音是从哪来的?
But... Where's that humming coming from?

155
00:09:38,814 --> 00:09:40,605
你是什么?
What are you?

156
00:09:42,522 --> 00:09:45,272
我听这个问题已经听烦了
I am getting really tired of that question.

157
00:09:47,147 --> 00:09:48,855
什么问题?
What question?

158
00:09:48,897 --> 00:09:49,522
啊啊啊啊!
Ahh!

159
00:09:49,897 --> 00:09:51,064
你是什么啊!?
What are you!?

160
00:09:51,230 --> 00:09:53,439
噢 这个问题啊
Oh, that question.

161
00:09:53,605 --> 00:09:55,605
这不是很明显吗?
Isn't it obvious?

162
00:09:55,730 --> 00:09:57,605
我是个草药家
Iam an herbalist.

163
00:09:57,772 --> 00:10:04,980
那个草药家 直到我不再是了为止
The Herbalist, at least until I'm not anymore.

164
00:10:05,439 --> 00:10:06,730
噢 很好
Oh good.

165
00:10:06,939 --> 00:10:09,564
那所有问题都回答完了
Well, all questions answered then.

166
00:10:09,647 --> 00:10:11,314
呃 抱歉打扰您了
Umm, sorry to bother.

167
00:10:11,439 --> 00:10:14,689
但是 我跟我的朋友们需要帮助
But, uh. my friends and I could use some help.

168
00:10:15,439 --> 00:10:18,147
我们想要去到那棵树的位置 但是
See, we're trying to get to that giant tree, but...

169
00:10:18,314 --> 00:10:21,105
需要帮助去找树?
Help getting to the tree?

170
00:10:21,605 --> 00:10:26,314
啊 是的 现在这个时代所有人都需要帮助
Ah, yes. Everyone needs help these days.

171
00:10:26,355 --> 00:10:28,314
所有人
Everyone.

172
00:10:40,689 --> 00:10:44,897
所以你到底要不要进来?
Well, are you coming in, or aren't you?

173
00:10:44,939 --> 00:10:49,105
你能帮我们做变大芭菲的 对吧?
You can make us a grow-gurt parfait, right?

174
00:11:00,272 --> 00:11:05,647
我必须得说 你们有点 犹犹豫豫的
I must say, you all seem a bit, uh... hesitant.

175
00:11:05,730 --> 00:11:08,480
你说你们是什么来着?
What did you say you were again?

176
00:11:08,522 --> 00:11:11,230
我们是猎人
We're... Huntresses.

177
00:11:11,397 --> 00:11:15,814
猎人具体是做什么的?
And what exactly does a Huntress do?

178
00:11:15,939 --> 00:11:18,564
打怪 大概是这样?
Fight monsters, I guess?

179
00:11:18,897 --> 00:11:21,272
不好意思 我不明白这个问题有什么意义
I'm sorry, I don't understand why this matters.

180
00:11:21,314 --> 00:11:24,439
我也不明白你怎么会不明白
I don't understand how you don't understand.

181
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,439
我是个草药家
I am an herbalist.

182
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:30,397
我为旅途中人制作草药和道具来帮助他们
I make medicines and remedies to help others on their journeys.

183
00:11:30,439 --> 00:11:32,605
这就是我
It is what I am.

184
00:11:33,730 --> 00:11:38,605
所以 你知道猎人是做什么的吗 还是你只能靠猜的?
So, do you know what a Huntress is, or do you guess?

185
00:11:38,814 --> 00:11:40,897
猎人是英雄
Huntresses are heroes.

186
00:11:41,105 --> 00:11:43,564
我们负责保护那些无法保护自己的人
We protect those who can't protect themselves.

187
00:11:44,105 --> 00:11:45,564
谢谢
Thank you.

188
00:11:46,314 --> 00:11:51,272
那么 你觉得你是个好猎人吗?
Now, would you say that you're good Huntresses?

189
00:11:52,855 --> 00:11:54,814
所以你到底要不要帮我们?
Look, can you help us or not?

190
00:11:54,855 --> 00:11:57,397
我在试图帮你!
I am trying!

191
00:11:58,147 --> 00:12:03,022
但是你们让情况搞得过于复杂了
But you're making this far more complicated than it needs to be.

192
00:12:03,189 --> 00:12:06,730
我们都有自己的名讳 自己的身份
We all have our titles, our roles to play.

193
00:12:06,772 --> 00:12:15,564
但如果我要帮助你成为你需要成为的人 那你必须要明白你现在究竟是谁
But in order to help you become whatever it is you need to become you should really have a better understanding of what you are now.

194
00:12:16,272 --> 00:12:17,272
行吧?
Okay..?

195
00:12:17,314 --> 00:12:20,522
我们要怎么打开蘑菇门?
How do we open mushroom door?

196
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:25,439
竟是你们这样的存在让我们失去了国王
This is how our king winds up a prince.

197
00:12:25,897 --> 00:12:27,022
跟我来!
Follow me!

198
00:12:27,230 --> 00:12:30,064
我的工作永远无法结束
My work is never done.

199
00:12:51,814 --> 00:12:54,814
请坐
Please, take a seat.

200
00:12:55,230 --> 00:13:00,355
呃 我想 我们可能还是要先告辞了
Ummm, actually, I think maybe we should be going.

201
00:13:00,730 --> 00:13:01,689
对吧 Ruby?
Right, Ruby?

202
00:13:01,897 --> 00:13:04,022
不会太久的
This won't take long.

203
00:13:06,897 --> 00:13:10,522
回答问题就是了
Just answer the questions.

204
00:13:15,397 --> 00:13:19,897
你是什么?
What are you?

205
00:13:29,147 --> 00:13:29,772
不要!
No!

206
00:13:30,439 --> 00:13:32,605
你确定你知道吗?
Are you sure you know?

207
00:13:33,439 --> 00:13:39,939
你要确认你是什么 以及你希望自己变成什么样
You have to be sure of what you are, and of what you are going be.

208
00:13:39,980 --> 00:13:42,189
Blake! Ruby!
Blake! Ruby!

209
00:13:50,730 --> 00:13:51,730
什么?
What?

210
00:13:51,980 --> 00:13:53,730
你不需要向前走的 你知道吗
You don't have to go forward, you know.

211
00:13:53,897 --> 00:13:55,147
你可以往回走
You could go back.

212
00:13:55,897 --> 00:13:57,105
回到从前
Back to before.

213
00:13:57,689 --> 00:13:58,522
什么?
What?

214
00:13:59,855 --> 00:14:01,397
你在说什么?
What are you talking about?

215
00:14:01,772 --> 00:14:03,814
这很简单 真的
It's simple, really.

216
00:14:04,189 --> 00:14:05,814
你可以只是人类
You could just be human.

217
00:14:06,189 --> 00:14:09,272
或者 只是只猫 只要你想
Or, just a cat, if you wanted.

218
00:14:09,814 --> 00:14:12,230
这都取决于你
Really, it's up to you.

219
00:14:12,730 --> 00:14:14,230
我为什么要那么做?
Why would I do that?

220
00:14:14,564 --> 00:14:17,064
就像我说的 这很简单
Like I said, it's simple.

221
00:14:17,689 --> 00:14:22,147
比试图去做人类与弗纳人之间的桥梁要简单多了
Much simpler than trying to be a bridge between humans and Faunus.

222
00:14:22,189 --> 00:14:25,230
为什么要为这个责任痛苦下去呢?
Why struggle with that responsibility?

223
00:14:25,939 --> 00:14:27,230
雪倪之名
The Schnee name.

224
00:14:27,605 --> 00:14:29,022
为什么还要在乎?
Why bother anymore?

225
00:14:29,064 --> 00:14:31,105
这个名字现在到底是什么?
What does it even stand for now?

226
00:14:31,397 --> 00:14:33,605
你大可以成为一个普通人
Instead you could be a nobody.

227
00:14:33,897 --> 00:14:35,147
你能想象吗?
Could you imagine?

228
00:14:35,230 --> 00:14:38,022
肩上不再有重担
Not a single bit of baggage on your shoulders.

229
00:14:38,272 --> 00:14:39,730
这不是你想要的吗?
Isn't that what you want?

230
00:14:40,605 --> 00:14:41,689
成为自由的人?
To be free?

231
00:14:41,730 --> 00:14:43,730
过着简单的生活?
To be something simpler?

232
00:14:43,772 --> 00:14:45,730
再次完整?
To be whole again?

233
00:14:47,314 --> 00:14:48,105
不
No.

234
00:14:48,647 --> 00:14:55,814
我所失去的 我的失败 这些成就了现在的我
My losses, my failures, those, more than anything, are what've shaped me into who I am.

235
00:14:55,855 --> 00:14:58,022
让我知道我该如何成长
Showed me how I need to grow.

236
00:14:58,439 --> 00:15:01,189
如果我还缺些什么 那一定不是因为我将它弄丢了
If there's something I'm missing, it's not because I've lost it.

237
00:15:01,522 --> 00:15:03,189
而是我还没有找到
It's 'cause I haven't found it yet.

238
00:15:03,605 --> 00:15:05,564
那我就我必须继续向前 才能找到
And the only way to do that is to keep going.

239
00:15:05,605 --> 00:15:08,355
更简单的人生不是我的人生
A simple life wouldn't be my life.

240
00:15:08,939 --> 00:15:11,689
我的家人 朋友 背景
My family, my friends, my culture..

241
00:15:12,147 --> 00:15:15,480
我的人生由他们构成 而他们也有我的参与
I belong to them, just as much as they belong to me.

242
00:15:15,939 --> 00:15:19,105
要我放弃这一切才不是简单的人生
To give that all away, wouldn't be simplicity.

243
00:15:19,355 --> 00:15:20,730
那只是背叛
It would be betrayal.

244
00:15:20,897 --> 00:15:22,730
我不知道你觉得你是谁
I don't know who you think you are.

245
00:15:22,772 --> 00:15:24,730
但是让我告诉你我是谁
But let me tell you who I am.

246
00:15:24,772 --> 00:15:28,105
我是英雄的孙女 恶棍的女儿
I am the granddaughter of a hero, and the child of a villain.

247
00:15:28,314 --> 00:15:30,314
我是一个陨落帝国的子民
I am a citizen of a fallen kingdom.

248
00:15:30,355 --> 00:15:32,064
是已经不存在的家族的继承人
And an heir to nothing.

249
00:15:32,230 --> 00:15:36,355
我不会让我的名字定义我是谁 我将会去赋予这个名字新的定义
I will not be defined by my name because I will be the one to define it.

250
00:15:36,689 --> 00:15:40,272
我是Weiss Schnee 我是个猎人
I am Weiss Schnee, and I am a Huntress.

251
00:15:40,314 --> 00:15:43,855
我是个猎人
I am a Huntress.

252
00:15:45,314 --> 00:15:48,647
所以啊 你是个猎人吗?
So, are you a Huntress?

253
00:15:50,064 --> 00:15:52,564
就像你在书里读过的那些一样?
Like the ones you've read about in books?

254
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:57,980
我 我不知道
I... I don't know.

255
00:15:59,105 --> 00:16:01,730
他们永远能拯救一切 对吧?
They always saved the day, didn't they?

256
00:16:02,105 --> 00:16:03,897
总是知道该怎么做
Always knew what to do.

257
00:16:04,689 --> 00:16:06,355
最后总是会赢
Always won in the end.

258
00:16:07,314 --> 00:16:10,939
但是 人生不是童话故事
But, life isn't like a fairytale.

259
00:16:11,314 --> 00:16:11,939
对啊!
That's right!

260
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:15,480
所以需要你来拯救一切 是吧?
It's up to you to make things better, isn't it?

261
00:16:16,397 --> 00:16:18,772
一切都靠你了
Everything all depends on you.

262
00:16:19,397 --> 00:16:20,897
你的姐姐需要你
Your sister needs you.

263
00:16:21,189 --> 00:16:22,564
你的朋友们需要你
Your friends need you.

264
00:16:22,772 --> 00:16:26,897
整个世界都需要你不停战斗
The whole world needs you to keep fighting for ever and ever.

265
00:16:26,939 --> 00:16:30,730
去对抗一个无敌的怪物 害死了你妈妈的怪物
Against an invincible monster that took your mother.

266
00:16:32,397 --> 00:16:33,730
妈妈是最强的
Mom was the best.

267
00:16:34,605 --> 00:16:35,605
但连她都失败了
But even she failed.

268
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:37,897
这似乎不公平
That doesn't seem fair.

269
00:16:38,897 --> 00:16:40,147
这一切都不公平
None of this seems fair.

270
00:16:42,105 --> 00:16:43,855
我该怎么做?
What am I supposed to do?

271
00:16:45,189 --> 00:16:47,314
你想怎么做都可以!
You can do whatever you want!

272
00:16:47,689 --> 00:16:49,314
你可以成为你自己想要的!
Be whoever you want!

273
00:16:49,689 --> 00:16:52,230
你甚至不需要再是Ruby Rose
You don't even have to be Ruby Rose.

274
00:16:57,522 --> 00:16:59,939
所以呀 你要当什么呢?
So, what are you gunna be?

275
00:17:02,647 --> 00:17:04,522
离她远点!
Get away from her!

276
00:17:09,355 --> 00:17:11,897
哎呦呦! 好像吸多了
Oh my! That's a bit much.

277
00:17:11,939 --> 00:17:15,064
草药 你看看你自己
Herb, look at yourself.

278
00:17:15,522 --> 00:17:16,314
你要完了
You're done.

279
00:17:16,814 --> 00:17:19,439
你应该是要帮助别人找回自我
You're supposed to be helping others find their way.

280
00:17:19,855 --> 00:17:21,439
但你连你自己都找不到了
But you've lost your own.

281
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:22,772
让我帮帮你吧
Please, let me help.

282
00:17:23,439 --> 00:17:25,314
收下一些我的心
And take a little bit of my heart.

283
00:17:26,355 --> 00:17:27,439
会让你感觉好些的
You'll feel much better.

284
00:17:29,064 --> 00:17:30,897
我深感抱歉
I do apologize.

285
00:17:31,105 --> 00:17:35,022
我一直有点工作狂
I always was a bit of a workaholic.

286
00:17:35,439 --> 00:17:37,855
猎人 是吧?
Huntresses, was it?

287
00:17:38,064 --> 00:17:41,189
嗯哼 真是特别
Hmm... Peculiar things.

288
00:17:47,439 --> 00:17:50,105
噢 我找到猫猫了!
Oh, I found the cat!